    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the economic development law, in relation to the promotion of\nlocal small businesses listed on the registry of historic businesses",
    "basePrintNo": "S798",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S798-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
